WEBVTT

00:08:59.402 --> 00:09:02.398
that is shrinking.

00:09:02.398 --> 00:09:04.687
But for the first time

00:09:04.687 --> 00:09:07.905
in three decades into this epidemic

00:09:07.905 --> 00:09:12.022
we have a real chance to come to grips with HIV.

00:09:12.022 --> 00:09:13.988
But in order to do that

00:09:13.988 --> 00:09:17.887
we need to tackle an epidemic of really bad law.

00:09:17.887 --> 00:09:19.505
It's for this reason

00:09:19.505 --> 00:09:21.635
that the Global Commission on HIV and the Law,

00:09:21.635 --> 00:09:22.934
of which I'm a member,

00:09:22.934 --> 00:09:26.000
was established by the agencies of the United Nations --

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.650
to look at the ways that legal environments

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:30.667
are affecting people living with HIV